DECLARE `Plot's tenure` IS ONE OF Owner, Tenant, Lodger
DECLARE Plot HAS
    `the owner` IS A STRING
    tenure      IS A `Plot's tenure`

@export default Whether the plot is let
GIVEN p IS A Plot
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is let` p IF p's tenure EQUALS Tenant OR p's tenure EQUALS Lodger

#EVAL `is let` (Plot WITH `the owner` IS "x", tenure IS Lodger)
